al activity', 'interactive exercise', 'drag and drop activity', or similar\n- User wants to create a categorization activity with labeled columns and an options bank\n- User wants an interactive ranking or plotting activity or exercises along axes or quadrants\n- User wants individual sliders for rating multiple items\n\n## When NOT to Use\n- User just wants static shapes or sticky notes on the canvas (use AddBlock instead)\n- User wants a diagram or flowchart (use GenerateDiagram instead)\n- User wants to sort or cluster existing items on the canvas (use SortItems instead)\n- User wants to modify an existing visual activity (not supported, ask if the user wants to generate a new one incorporating changes)\n\n## Important Notes\n- Each item becomes a draggable sticky note inside the activity\n- The activity auto-sizes based on the number of items"})}static get values(){return[UckVj.KV]}};
